    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "A substantial brick built Pre ‘63 investment currently arranged as three spacious full-floor apartments (2 x 2 beds & 1 x 3 bed).  Extending to approx. 160 sq. m. and requiring some modernization, the house presents an exceptional opportunity for an investor with market rent available immediately or alternatively it can be easily converted into a stylish family home. \r\nAdditional features include a garage to the side, a generous front driveway with off-street parking, and valuable rear vehicular access via Broadstone Avenue, enhancing both practicality and long-term development potential.\r\n\r\nThe property is nicely set back approximately 7 meters from the road behind elegant wrought-iron railings. The front garden is finished in low-maintenance gravel and is bordered by a traditional brick wall adjoining the driveway, which provides off-street parking and access to the garage. The garage, approx.. 6.5m x 2.6m, requires some maintenance but presents an excellent opportunity for extension, subject to the necessary planning permissions. The rear yard is accessed via a roller shutter door from Broadstone Avenue,  measuring approx.. 9.7m x 7.2m (max) and benefits from a sunny aspect, making it an ideal outdoor space for relaxation and entertaining.\r\n\r\nThis prime city location is second to none with the LUAS (Broadstone) approx. 200 meters away, fashionable Phibsborough Village is at the top of the road with its vibrant cafés, restaurants and shopping. The TU Dublin Campus is also situated within a short walk as is the Blessington Street Basin and linear park. Viewing is highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Hall Level \r\n\r\nEntrance Hall: \t\t4.70m x 1.71m \r\n\r\nApartment 2 \r\n\r\nLiving room: \t\t\t3.95m x 2.27m \r\n\r\nKitchen: \t\t\t        1.54m x 1.37m \t\tfitted kitchen with tiled floor, plumbed for washing machine.\r\n\r\nShower Room:\t        1.48m x 1.04m  \t        part tiled, WC, wash-hand basin and shower with glass screen. \r\n\r\nBedroom 1: \t\t\t4.30m x 1.95m \t\tdouble bedroom with fitted wardrobes\r\n\r\nBedroom 2: \t\t\t3.28m x 1.88m \t\tdouble bedroom with fitted wardrobes \r\n\r\nFirst Floor \r\n\r\nApartment 1 \r\n\r\nLiving Room/Kitchen: \t\t4.26m x 3.91m  \t        wooden floor, fitted kitchen plumber for washing machine, splashback.\r\n\r\nShower Room:\t\t\t2.33m x 1.05m \t\tpart tiled with shower WC and wash-hand basin.\t\r\n\r\nBedroom 1: \t\t\t        2.39m x 3.31m  \r\n\r\nBedroom 2: \t\t\t       3.22m x 3.13m  \r\n\r\nLower ground floor \r\n\r\nApartment 3 \r\n\r\nKitchen/Living Room: \t\t3.91m x 3.46m \t\tfitted kitchen with tiled floor fitted units + splashback.\r\n\r\nBedroom 1:\t\t\t        3.06m x 1.84m\t\tdouble bedroom with fitted wardrobes\r\n\r\nBedroom 2: \t\t\t        3.05m x 2.60m \t\tdouble bedroom with fitted wardrobes\r\n\r\nShower Room: \t\t\t1.13m x 2.27m  \t        part tiled, WC, wash-hand basin and shower \r\n\r\nBedroom 3: \t\t\t        2.30m x 2.10m \r\n\r\nRear: \t\t\t\t        9.02m x 2.28m"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Central location adjacent to Phibsborough Village\r\nVacant possession available  \r\nIdeal for conversion to family home\r\nUnits not subject to RPZ restrictions\r\nGarage with further development potential ( subject to p.p.)\r\nRear vehicular access via Broadstone Avenue  \r\nOff street parking to front"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: Exempt"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Directions",
        "SortOrder": 5,
        "Content": "Traveling for Phibsborough towards the city, continue down Phibsborough Road past the fire station and the house is on the left hand side. See for sale sign."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Viewing Details",
        "SortOrder": 6,
        "Content": "Strictly by appointment only"
      }
    ],
